  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "It is morning. Tom is with Grandma. \"Come and eat!\" says Grandma. Tom sits at the table. \"I want bread, please.\" \"Here you are,\" says Grandma. \"Thank you!\"",
      "\"What can you see?\" asks Grandma. \"Two eggs,\" says Tom. \"And ten beans!\" \"Can I count them?\" \"Yes, you can.\" Tom counts the beans. \"One, two, three, four, five.\" \"Six, seven, eight, nine, ten!\" \"Ten beans!\"",
      "A cat comes to the table. It is gray. \"What is her name?\" asks Tom. \"Her name is Sue,\" says Grandma. Sue wants breakfast too. Tom gives Sue milk. Sue is happy. Breakfast is fun!"
    ],
